title: "MiniROCKET-sEMG-CrossSubject-DomainAdaptation: code and results for a multi-seed benchmark of unsupervised domain adaptation on NinaPro DB2, DB3 and DB7"
abstract: "Code, per-subject and per-seed results, tables and figures for a subject-held-out benchmark of CORAL, Transfer Component Analysis and Subspace Alignment on reference multivariate MiniROCKET features of surface EMG (NinaPro DB2, DB3, DB7; 73 held-out subjects, five seeds)."
